  message: "Shipped via PR #198. type_hierarchy linker now closes parent_to_children transitively via new close_parent_to_children_transitively helper (BFS with cycle guard) before edge emission, so skip-level grandparent overrides are emitted (Grandparent.foo → Grandchild.foo when intermediate Parent doesn't override). 6 closure-helper unit tests + 4 link_type_hierarchy property tests; 100% coverage. Per BVT discipline: tagging awaits_bakeoff_validation + for_deep_bakeoff (DEEP signal: dispatches_to edge count delta on real-world repos with deep inheritance hierarchies; this is a coverage-breadth claim that fits DEEP rather than UAT)."  # 72bc
